#: ../../development/testing.md:110 26691c16be0a4860942e926f286b1770
msgid "Production Artifact Gate"
msgstr "生产产物门禁"

#: ../../development/testing.md:112 aad835f3add4414e9537f7e111a39f66
msgid "Run the authoritative production build with:"
msgstr "使用以下命令运行权威生产构建："

#: ../../development/testing.md:118 e3a327055bd84c2289f3d7618be91ad6
msgid ""
"The build uses Webpack and automatically invokes `npm run "
"verify:standalone`. The verifier requires the compiled authentication "
"proxy and fails if `.next/standalone` contains runtime databases, active "
"environment files, backups, application source, tests, documentation, or "
"local scratch directories. New runtime state must stay outside the Docker"
" build context. Only relax the verifier for an asset that the production "
"runtime intentionally needs, and verify the resulting Docker image "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"构建使用 Webpack，并自动调用 `npm run verify:standalone`。校验器要求包含已编译的认证代理；如果 "
"`.next/standalone` 中出现运行时数据库、活动环境文件、备份、应用源码、测试、文档或本地临时目录，构建将失败。"
"新的运行时状态必须保留在 Docker 构建上下文之外。只有生产运行时确实需要某项资源时才放宽校验器，"
"并应单独验证生成的 Docker 镜像。"

#: ../../development/testing.md:126 b95ca15847ae4470ad59bf7112498e59
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr "最佳实践"

#: ../../development/testing.md:128 7932db8e9eb64fc18af46c586cd47d94
msgid ""
"**Co-locate** test files with source files (e.g., `module.test.ts` next "
"to `module.ts`)"
msgstr "将测试文件与源文件**放在一起**（例如 `module.test.ts` 与 `module.ts` 相邻）"

#: ../../development/testing.md:129 5a716990353f4458a402693f7b4b58b5
msgid "**Use descriptive names** for test cases that explain expected behavior"
msgstr "为测试用例**使用描述性名称**，说明预期行为"

#: ../../development/testing.md:130 0ca8c9917721468aa69e33aa7a43cc5a
msgid "**Test edge cases** — empty inputs, null values, boundary conditions"
msgstr "**测试边界情况** —— 空输入、null 值、边界条件"

#: ../../development/testing.md:131 95cdb1687e9e43d9be79de558e5804cb
msgid "**Mock external dependencies** — API calls, file system operations"
msgstr "**模拟外部依赖** —— API 调用、文件系统操作"

#: ../../development/testing.md:132 b0d43d7ec51c411988d62d62d5420745
msgid "**Keep tests focused** — each test should verify one specific behavior"
msgstr "**保持测试聚焦** —— 每个测试应验证一个特定行为"
